        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>MegaFactory Tycoon</strong>, you are the manager of a fully automated factory.<br>The factory produces consumer products that can be sold for profit on the central market.<br><br>You decide the factory layout, place production machines and connect them with conveyor belts.<br>You also set up the logistics for trucks to transport consumer products to the central market and return with raw materials for additional production.<br>Eventually you will also be able to create blueprints for common layouts, allowing you to expand even quicker by placing an entire group of machines and belts in a single action.<br><br>As you reach certain milestones, you will unlock technologies that allow you to produce new and more advanced products, for even greater profit.<br><br>As you expand your factory, you will eventually reach its limit in size, but it does not end there.<br>You can purchase additional empty factories and fill them with machines as well.<br>Advanced quantum technology innovations let you efficiently teleport items between factories. One factory can produce intermediate products for another factory to use as input.<br><br>Every factory is fully simulated in real-time.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>MegaFactory Tycoon</strong>, you are the manager of a fully automated factory.<br>The factory produces consumer products that can be sold for profit on the central market.<br><br>You decide the factory layout, place production machines and connect them with conveyor belts.<br>You also set up the logistics for trucks to transport consumer products to the central market and return with raw materials for additional production.<br>Eventually you will also be able to create blueprints for common layouts, allowing you to expand even quicker by placing an entire group of machines and belts in a single action.<br><br>As you reach certain milestones, you will unlock technologies that allow you to produce new and more advanced products, for even greater profit.<br><br>As you expand your factory, you will eventually reach its limit in size, but it does not end there.<br>You can purchase additional empty factories and fill them with machines as well.<br>Advanced quantum technology innovations let you efficiently teleport items between factories. One factory can produce intermediate products for another factory to use as input.<br><br>Every factory is fully simulated in real-time.</p>",
        "short_description": "In MegaFactory Tycoon, you are the manager of a fully automated factory. The factory produces consumer products that can be sold for profit on the central market. The factory is fully simulated in real-time.",
